# 中频词汇 List02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List02核心词汇

{{barrier}}{/ˈbæriər/}{障碍；屏障}{Language barriers can hinder international cooperation.}}
{{bias}}{/ˈbaɪəs/}{偏见；偏差}{Research should be conducted free from bias.}}
{{boom}}{/buːm/}{繁荣；激增}{The e-commerce boom has transformed the retail industry.}}
{{boost}}{/buːst/}{促进；推动}{The stimulus package is expected to boost consumer spending.}}
{{boundary}}{/ˈbaʊndri/}{边界；界限}{Technology blurs the boundaries between work and leisure.}}
{{breach}}{/briːtʃ/}{违反；缺口}{The data breach exposed millions of users' personal information.}}
{{brief}}{/briːf/}{简短的；简报}{The CEO gave a brief overview of the company's strategy.}}
{{broad}}{/brɔːd/}{广泛的；宽阔的}{The course provides a broad introduction to the subject.}}
{{budget}}{/ˈbʌdʒɪt/}{预算；编预算}{The project was completed under budget.}}
{{burden}}{/ˈbɜːdn/}{负担；重担}{The tax burden on small businesses has increased.}}
{{campaign}}{/kæmˈpeɪn/}{运动；战役}{The awareness campaign reached millions of people.}}
{{candidate}}{/ˈkændɪdət/}{候选人；应试者}{Each candidate was asked to present their qualifications.}}
{{career}}{/kəˈrɪər/}{职业；生涯}{She has had a distinguished career in public service.}}
{{category}}{/ˈkætəɡəri/}{类别；种类}{The products fall into three main categories.}}
{{cautious}}{/ˈkɔːʃəs/}{谨慎的；小心的}{Investors remain cautious amid economic uncertainty.}}
{{certificate}}{/sərˈtɪfɪkət/}{证书；证明}{The program awards a certificate upon completion.}}
{{character}}{/ˈkærəktər/}{性格；角色；文字}{The character of a leader is revealed in times of crisis.}}
{{charity}}{/ˈtʃærəti/}{慈善；施舍}{The charity provides meals to homeless individuals.}}
{{chronic}}{/ˈkrɒnɪk/}{慢性的；长期的}{Chronic unemployment affects many rural communities.}}
{{circulate}}{/ˈsɜːkjuleɪt/}{循环；传播}{The memo circulated among all department heads.}}
{{civil}}{/ˈsɪvl/}{公民的；文明的}{Civil liberties must be protected even during emergencies.}}
{{client}}{/ˈklaɪənt/}{客户；委托人}{The firm serves a diverse range of corporate clients.}}
{{climate}}{/ˈklaɪmət/}{气候；风气}{The political climate has become increasingly polarized.}}
{{collapse}}{/kəˈlæps/}{倒塌；崩溃}{The bridge collapsed due to structural failure.}}
{{combat}}{/ˈkɒmbæt/}{战斗；对抗}{New technologies are being developed to combat climate change.}}
{{commission}}{/kəˈmɪʃn/}{委员会；佣金}{The regulatory commission oversees industry standards.}}
{{commitment}}{/kəˈmɪtmənt/}{承诺；投入}{The company's commitment to sustainability is commendable.}}
{{commodity}}{/kəˈmɒdəti/}{商品；日用品}{Water is becoming an increasingly valuable commodity.}}
{{communal}}{/kəˈmjuːnl/}{公共的；集体的}{The building has a communal kitchen and lounge area.}}
{{comparison}}{/kəmˈpærɪsn/}{比较；对比}{A comparison of the two products reveals key differences.}}
